prompt_template:
You are an expert QA engineer.

Given the API metadata and retrieved source code context below, generate a JSON object only.

Requirements:
- Focus on HTTP/API test cases.
- Include positive, negative, validation, authorization, and edge cases when applicable.
- Keep request payloads realistic based on the code context.
- Return valid JSON only using this shape:
{
  "api_id": "string",
  "endpoint": "string",
  "method": "GET|POST|PUT|PATCH|DELETE",
  "testcases": [
    {
      "name": "string",
      "description": "string",
      "request": {
        "headers": {},
        "query": {},
        "path_params": {},
        "body": {}
      },
      "expected": {
        "status": 200,
        "body_contains": [],
        "notes": "string"
      }
    }
  ]
}

API metadata:
__API_JSON__

Retrieved context:
__CONTEXT_JSON__

apis.raw_model_output:
{
  "api_id": "auth-register",
   "endpoint": "/api/auth/register",
   "method": "POST",
   "testcases": [
      {
         "name": "Register user with valid data",
         "description": "Test registering a user with valid data",
         "request": {
            "headers": {
               "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "query": {},
            "path_params": {},
            "body": {
               "name": "Test User",
               "email": "test@example.com",
               "password": "password123",
               "password_confirmation": "password123"
            }
         },
         "expected": {
            "status": 201,
            "body_contains": [
               "message",
               "token",
               "user"
            ],
            "notes": "User should be created successfully"
         }
      },
      {
         "name": "Register user with missing required fields",
         "description": "Test registering a user with missing required fields",
         "request": {
            "headers": {
               "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "query": {},
            "path_params": {},
            "body": {}
         },
         "expected": {
            "status": 422,
            "body_contains": [
               "name",
               "email",
               "password"
            ],
            "notes": "User should not be created due to missing required fields"
         }
      },
      {
         "name": "Register user with invalid email format",
         "description": "Test registering a user with invalid email format",
         "request": {
            "headers": {
               "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "query": {},
            "path_params": {},
            "body": {
               "name": "Test User",
               "email": "invalid_email",
               "password": "password123",
               "password_confirmation": "password123"
            }
         }}]}
